          "relation": "definition",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 67,
            "text": "noncomputable def SupportedGauge (a b : ℝ) (ell : S → ℝ) (U : Set S)\n    (f : PressureStream.Lift S → ℝ) : Prop :=\n  ∀ z, z.2.1 ∈ U → f z ≠ 0 → z.1 ∈ Icc (ell z.2.1 * a) (ell z.2.1 * b)"
